TRANSLATION:
Selam, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}kusura bakma!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Bir dakika kulağını
ödünç verir misin?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Uzun sürmez.

{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Bakalım...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ee...{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Hah, doğru. Önce
adam gibi kendimi tanıtayım.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Adım {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Resetti{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Çoğu kişi bana Bay{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}} Resetti{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} der,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
malum, toplumun saygın bir üyesiyim.
Seninle çalışmak güzel olacak!

EN:
{{TAG:0000:0002:4B00}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}Course,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} this'll probably be the
last time ya ever see me since
there ain't no center or nothin'{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Ahem,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} so, it says here you quit
without saving last time ya played.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Care to explain yourself?{{TAG:000F:0001:000000000000}}
I wanted a do-over.
My batteries ran out.
I had no choice!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0000:0002:4B00}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}Gerçi{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ortada merkez falan
kalmadığına göre beni son görüşün
bu olabilir{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Öhö,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} kayıtlara göre son oynayışında
kaydetmeden çıkmışsın.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Bir açıklaman var mı?{{TAG:000F:0001:000000000000}}
Baştan denemek istedim.
Pilim bitti.
Başka çarem yoktu!

ES:
{{TAG:0002:0004:}}{{TAG:000D:0000:00CD}}¡¿Cómo?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0002:0002:}}¿Qué me dices?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¿Tan grave ha sido la cosa?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0002:0005:}}Bueno, no quiero entrometerme.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Tú sabrás lo que ha pasado o
qué razones tienes, jovencit{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Solo espero que, sea lo que sea,{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
{{TAG:0002:0002:}}no vuelva a ocurrirte.

EN:
{{TAG:0002:0002:}}When they were drawin' up the
town budget for this fiscal year,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
folks were all like:
{{TAG:0002:0006:}}{{TAG:000D:0000:00CD}}"What's wrong with a little reset
every now and then?" "We don't
got the funds for this nonsense!"{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0002:0002:}}Blah blah and so on and so forth{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}So ya see, I ain't here on official
business or nothin'.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0002:0005:}}I'm just volunteerin' this once.
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}So next time you reset,{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}} I ain't
gonna pop out.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0002:0002:}}This is it.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ol' Resetti's out{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Course, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}if you were to use your{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
mayoral powers to restore the
center, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0002:0005:}}well that'd be different.
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}And{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} if that should come to pass,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0002:0002:}}{{TAG:000D:0000:00CD}}I'd be back on the job in full force!
Unstoppable mole power!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Tabii, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}başkanlık yetkilerini kullanıp{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
merkezi yeniden açarsan, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0002:0005:}}iş değişir.
{{TAG:0002:0008:}}Ve{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bir gün gerçekten olursa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0002:0002:}}{{TAG:000D:0000:00CD}}işimin başına bütün gücümle dönerim!
Durdurulamaz köstebek gücü!

EN:
{{TAG:0002:0004:}}But listen to me!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0002:0008:}}Runnin' my trap
like a fancy pirate or somethin'!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Good luck with all your future
endeavors! {{TAG:0002:0005:}}Take care now!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
And buh-{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}bye!{{TAG:0007:0009:50000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0002:0004:}}Ah, ma guardami!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0002:0008:}}Quando comincio
a parlare non la smetto più!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Buona fortuna per tutto, eh! {{TAG:0002:0005:}}
Stammi bene!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ciao ciao!{{TAG:0007:0009:50000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0002:0004:}}Şuna bak bana!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0002:0008:}}Sanki süslü püslü
bir korsanmışım gibi çenem düştü!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Bundan
sonraki bütün işlerinde
bol şans! {{TAG:0002:0005:}}Kendine iyi bak!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ve güle{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} güle!{{TAG:0007:0009:50000000}}
